-> laboratuvarı.
+Three controlled experiments over a synthetic 100,000-product catalog on SQL Server 2022 and
+Redis 7.4: a covering index, an EF Core projection, and a cache-aside read path under load.
+Plus a resumable, atomic CSV import whose crash behaviour is proven by tests rather than
